==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|flug|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*flugiz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/fluːk/|lang=de}} {{a|standard}}
* {{IPA|/fluːx/|lang=de}} {{a|northern and central Germany; chiefly colloquial}}
* {{audio|De-at-Flug.ogg|audio (Austria)}}
* {{rhymes|uːk|lang=de}}
* {{homophones|Pflug|Fluch|lang=de}} {{a|not according to standard pronunciation}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m|Flugs|gen2=Fluges|Flüge}}

